{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a79e6724-0bc6-8f3e-9632-142ed65fee26",
  "created_at": "2026-03-03T15:37:03-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sheila Dolan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T15:35:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T15:35:05-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Yes. Good afternoon. My name is Sheila Dolan. I have written down what I want to say, so please, I read slowly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T15:35:13-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time, Mrs. Dolan. I'm listening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T15:35:16-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. The streetlight in front of my house is out. It is out for about two weeks now. It is very dark on the sidewalk at night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T15:35:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a streetlight that's been out about two weeks. And what's the address where the light is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T15:35:31-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is thirty-six Howard Street. The light is on the pole in front of the house. Thirty-six. Howard Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T15:35:38-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thirty-six Howard Street, got it. That's in the Fifth Ward. Is the light completely dark, or does it flicker or come on and off?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T15:35:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um. [pause] Let me look at my paper. I did not write that. It is completely dark, I think. I do not see it flicker."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T15:35:54-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, dark is what I'll put down. Is there a number on the pole, like a little tag? Don't go out in the cold for it if it's hard to see."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T15:36:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I do not know. I did not look. I am sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T15:36:10-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No need to be sorry. The address will do. I'll send it over so a crew can check the pole."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T15:36:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is what I ask. Please, a crew to check the pole. That is the last thing on my paper."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T15:36:24-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Now, can I have a callback number in case the crew has a question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T15:36:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-seven-eight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T15:36:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-seven-eight. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T15:36:36-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. Excuse me, my voice is slow today. I was on a long video call this morning, with my family, and the battery of the phone is very tired. This is why I use the house telephone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T15:36:48-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That makes sense. Well, I have you down, Sheila Dolan, thirty-six Howard Street, streetlight out about two weeks, crew to check the pole."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T15:36:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Thank you very much for your help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T15:36:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T15:37:02-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goodbye."
    }
  ],
